Tue Nov 17 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- 0.4: the theme places everything again when the screen changes
  size after the splash has started (the firmware framebuffer first,
  then the graphics driver's own mode). Before, the logo kept the
  places worked out for the first, larger screen and showed shifted
  to the bottom right and cut off (installer boot in QEMU, Build15.6).
  The password field, its prompt and messages are placed again too.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Nov 16 16:30:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- 0.3: release layer, the Blavet sign and name small at the bottom of
  every screen (boot, disk password, shutdown, reboot), from
  release/mark.svg and RELEASE_NAME in vilna.script; the theme plays
  designer frames (logo-N.png, make_theme.py --frames) for the logo
  when they are there, instead of the circle and the swallow.
- The logo animation is now Dmytro Sizmin's 60 frames (2x) and the
  release sign his Blavet mark (CC-BY-SA-4.0, LICENSE.CC-BY-SA-4.0);
  the tarball carries them as frames/ and release/mark.svg. The theme
  grows from ~1.2 MB to ~4.4 MB in the initrd.

